                <pb facs="0211" n="199" sameAs="frus:frus1942v05/pg199"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/1456: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-05-15T17:00:00-03:00">May 15, 1942—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:45 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1650. My 1246, April 13, 1 p.m.<anchor n="25" xml:id="d192-f1"/> Local police
                    last night apprehended a second transmitter belonging to Nagy of the HTT group.
                    Inform FBI immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
